hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
3505,'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb kchh ghrybwn kay ghlam nay chnd amyrwn kay ghlam ka kan kat dya awr aap ky qwm aap sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aa kr khnay lgy kh wh ghryb hyn tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an pr kwyy maawzh nhyn lgaya۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔
3506,qal al bn b talb: n dm alz bdw qtlaً amdaً f slas jzaa: slas wslaswn jmlaً hnsaً f raba snta، wslas wslaswn jmlaً hnsaً f khams snta، wslas wslaswn jmlaً hnsaً f alsn alsads ht altasa، la haml. wf rwa qal: n dm alz bdw khtً ff rba jzaa: khms wslaswn jmlaً hnsaً f raba snta، wkhms wslaswn jmlaً hnsaً f khams snta، wkhms wslaswn jmlaً hnsaً f sals snta، wkhms wslaswn jmlaً hnsaً f san snta. bw dawd nql.*
3507,mjahd nay kha kh amr rzy allh anh nay fyslh dya kh amda qtl kay lyay khwn ky aql chwthay sal tys awntnyan، panchwyn sal tys awntnyan awr chhtay sal nwyn tk chalys hamlh awntnyan hwny chahyyn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3508,"sayd by۔ almsyb nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh man kay pyt myn maray janay walay bchay kay bdlay bhtryn mayar kay ghlam ya ghlam kw ada kya jayay۔ jb wh js kay khlaf yh fyslh snaya gya as say pwchha gya kh js nay nh khaya nh pya، nh bwla، nh aawaz blnd ky tw mjhay jrmanh kysay hw ga؟ anhwn nay mzyd kha kh as trh kay lyay maawzh ada nhyn kya jayay ga، khda kay rswl nay kha، \yh shkhs srf kahnwn say talq rkhta hay.\"" asay malk awr nsayy nay mrsl myn nql kya hay۔"""
3509,Abu Dawud ne isay unke aur **Abu Huraira (Radi Allahu Anhu)** ke hawalay se mukammal muttasil sanad ke saath riwayat kiya.
3510,abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”gwngay janwr، kan ya knwyn say lgnay walay zkhm pr kwyy bdlh nhyn hay۔ 380۔ hwalh as janwr kw kha jata hay jw as wqt ksy kay zmh nh hw۔ ksy bhy shkhs pr kwyy zmh dary aayd nhyn hwty js nay ksy aysy jgh pr kan ya knwan khwda hw jhan kwyy gr jayay tw asay aysa krnay ka hq hay۔
3511,"yala by۔ amyh rzy allh anh nay kha: myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath msybt zdh fwj kay lyay gya tha، awr myray pas ayk mlazm tha jw ayk aadmy say lra، js myn say ayk nay dwsray ka hath kat lya۔ js kw kata gya tha as nay katnay walay kay mnh say apna hath khynch lya awr as ka agla dant jw nkl gya tha akhar dya۔ wh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay aglay dant ka bdlh nhyn lya، awr kha، \kya as say twqa ky ja skty hay kh wh apna hath aap kay mnh myn chhwr day jb aap asay nr awnt ky trh kchl rhay thay؟\"" (bkhary w mslm) * as say mrad 9 hjry myn tbwk ky mhm hay۔ alqraan، 9:117۔"""
3512,abdallh by۔ amrw rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh jw shkhs apnay mal ky hfazt krtay hwyay mara jayay wh shhyd hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3513,"abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aadmy aaya awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say arz kya kh agr kwyy shkhs as ka mal lynay kay lyay aayay tw asay kya krna chahyay؟ as nay jwab dya kh asay apna mal mt dw۔ as nay as say pwchha kh asay btao kh agr wh aadmy as say lray tw asay kya krna hay، awr as nay jwab dya، \as say lrw۔\"" as nay as say pwchha kh btao agr as shkhs nay asay qtl kr dya tw kya hw ga، as nay jwab dya، \""tm shhyd hw gay۔\"" as nay as say pwchha kh asay btao kh agr as nay as aadmy kw mar dala tw kya hwga، awr as nay jwab dya، \""wh jhnm myn jayay ga۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
3514,as nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh agr kwyy aap ky ajazt kay bghyr aap kay ghr myn jhank kr dykhay awr aap as pr knkry mar kr as ky aankh nkal dyn tw aap pr kwyy jrm nhyn hwga۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3515,shl b۔ sad rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay drwazay kay swrakh myn say dykha tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk chwlh tha js say aap apna sr nwch rhay thay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr mjhay malwm hwta kh tm mjhay dykh rhay hw tw myn tmhary aankhwn myn jhwnk dwn ga، kywnkh ajazt srf as lyay mqrr ky gyy hay kh lwg kya dykh sktay hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3516,abdallh by mghfl nay byan kya kh myn nay ayk aadmy kw knkryan phynktay hwyay dykha awr kha kh aysa nh krw، kywnkh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as say mna kya tha، awr frmaya tha kh as trh khyl nhyn pkra jata، nh dshmn zkhmy hwta hay، lykn tm kbhy dant twr sktay hw ya aankh nkal sktay hw۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3517,abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy hmary msjd ya bazar myn tyr lay kr gzray tw asay chahyay kh an ky batwn kw smjh lay، khyn aysa nh hw kh an say ksy mslman kw kwyy nqsan phnch jayay۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3518,abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm myn say kwyy apnay bhayy ky trf hthyar nh maray، kywnkh wh nhyn janta kh shytan as kay hath myn hwtay hwyay asay nkal skta hay js ky wjh say wh jhnm kay grhay myn gr jayay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3519,anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh: ”jw shkhs apnay bhayy ky trf lwhay ka ayk tkra maray ga tw frshtay as pr lant bhyjyn gay yhan tk kh wh asay nychay rkh day، chahay wh as ka bhayy hy kywn nh hw js kay man bap ayk hy hwn۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔
3520,"abn amr awr abwhryrh rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js nay hm pr hthyar athayay wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya، awr mslm nay mzyd kha، \awr jw hmaray sath bay aymany krta hay wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔\"""""
3521,slamh by۔ alakw nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js nay hm pr tlwar chlayy wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔
3522,"hsham by۔ arwh nay apnay wald kay hkm pr btaya kh hsham bn۔ hkym sham myn baz nbatyn pr aayay jnhyn an kay srwn pr zytwn ka tyl dal kr dhwp myn khra kya gya tha۔ as kay pwchhnay pr kh as ka kya mtlb hay awr yh btanay pr kh wh zmyn kay tyks kay slslay myn sza bhgt rhay hyn، hsham nay kha kh wh as bat ky gwahy day skta hay kh wh khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna hay kh \khda an lwgwn kw sza day ga jw as dnya myn lwgwn kw sza dytay hyn۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
3523,"abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm twyl arsay tk zndh rhw gay tw anqryb lwgwn kw dykhw gay kh hath myn byl ky dm jysy chyzyn sbh kay wqt allh kay ghzb ky wjh say nkltay hyn awr sham kw allh ky narazgy kay sath waps aatay hyn۔ ayk wrzhn hay، \sham kw waps aana khda ky lant kay taba۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
3524,anhwn nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: dw tbqay aysay hyn jw jhnm myn jayyn gay jn kw myn nay nhyn dykha: wh lwg jn kw byl ky dm ky trh kwray martay hyn، awr wh awrtyn jn kay lbas say wh balkl brhnh hwtay hyn، jw mrdwn kw bhrkatay hyn awr mrdwn ky trf mayl hwtay hyn، jn kay srwn kay sr hlnay walay kwhan ky trh hwtay hyn، aysy awrtyn as myn dakhl nhyn hwn gy۔ halankh as ky khwshbw flan flan faslay say mhsws ky ja skty hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔
3525,anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy lray tw chhray say bchna chahyay، kywnkh allh taalyٰ nay aadm kw apny swrt pr pyda kya۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3526,"abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ajazt lynay say phlay prday kw htata hay awr ghr myn jhankta hay awr as myn kwyy aysy chyz dykhta hay jw as kay andr nzr nhyn aaty thy tw as nay aysa jrm kya js ka artkab as kay lyay jayz nhyn، agr kwyy aadmy as kay samnay jhank kr aankh nkalay tw myn as pr ayb nhyn lgaon ga، lykn agr kwyy shkhs as prday kw nhyn dykhta awr as nay drwazh khwla tw as nay kwyy gnah nhyn kya۔ kwyy gnah nhyn، kywnkh gnah ka talq srf andr kay lwgwn say hay۔\ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"""
3527,jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as bat say mna frmaya hay kh khynchy hwyy tlwar ksy kay hwalay ky jayay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔
3528,alhsn nay smrh ky snd pr kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mna frmaya hay kh jwty ka ayk tkra dw anglywn kay drmyan kata jayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3529,sayd by۔ zyd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw apnay dyn ky hfazt myn mara jayay wh shhyd hay، jw apny jan ky hfazt myn mara jayay wh shhyd hay، jw apnay mal ky hfazt myn mara jayay wh shhyd hay awr jw apnay ahl w ayal ky hfazt myn mara jayay wh shhyd hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔
3530,abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jhnm kay sat drwazay hyn، jn myn say ayk an lwgwn kay lyay hay jw myry amt pr tlwar chlatay hyn“ ya frmaya: mhmd sly allh alyh wslm ky amt kay khlaf۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔
3531,"rfya by۔ khdyj awr shl abw hatmh nay kha kh abdallh bn shl awr mhysh by۔ msawd khybr tshryf layay awr jb wh khjwr kay drkhtwn kay drmyan jda hw gyay tw abdallh bn shl mara gya۔ abdalrhmn b۔ shl awr hwysh، awr mhysh، msawd kay bytay، nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr btaya kh an kay dwst kay sath kya hwa tha۔ abdalrhmn jw sb say chhwtay thay sb say phlay bwlay lykn nby sly allh alyh wslm nay an say kbyr alkbr kha jw yhyyٰ bn nay kha tha۔ sayd ka mtlb hay \sb say bwrhay kw bwlnay dw۔\"" phr anhwn nay bat ky awr nby krym sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say pchas aadmywn ky qsmyn kha kr apnay mrdh kay baray myn mtalbh krw۔ anhwn nay jwab dya kh aay khda kay rswl yh aysy bat hay jw hm nay nhyn dykhy۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yhwd an myn say pchas ky qsm kha kr bry hw jayyn gay“ lykn anhwn nay jwab dya، ”khda kay rswl، yh kafr lwg hyn۔ chnanchh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn khwn ky qymt khwd ada ky۔ ayk wrzhn myn hay، \""aap kw pchas qsmyn khany chahyyn awr apnay mqtwl aadmy (ya، aap kay dwst) kay baray myn apna dawyٰ krna chahyay۔\"" phr khwd rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay sw awntnywn pr mshtml apnay khwn ky qymt ada ky۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""
3532,"rfya by۔ khdyj nay kha kh ansar myn say ayk khybr myn mara gya awr as kay rshth dar rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyay awr aap say as ka zkr kya۔ as nay pwchha kya tmharay pas dw aysay gwah hyn jw tmharay dwst kay qatl ky gwahy day skyn؟ anhwn nay jwab dya، \khda kay rswl، whan ayk bhy mslman mwjwd nhyn tha، blkh srf yhwdy mwjwd thay jw baz awqat as say bhy bra jrm krnay ky jrt rkhtay hyn\"" aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""phr an myn say pchas kw chn lyn awr an say byat lynay ka mtalbh kryn۔\"" lykn anhwn nay ankar kr dya awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay khwn ky qymt khwd ada ky۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""
3533,akrmh nay byan kya kh jb kchh bdatywn kw aly kay pas laya gya tw as nay anhyn jla dya awr jb abn abas kw as ky khbr mly tw anhwn nay kha kh agr wh hwtay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay mna krnay ky wjh say anhyn nh jlatay kh ksy pr azab alhy nh dalw، blkh an lwgwn kw qtl kr dytay jnhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay mzhb kw tbdyl kya tha۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔
3534,abdallh by۔ hzrt abas rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aag say azab srf allh hy dyta hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔
3535,aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”aakhry zmanay myn lwg nklyn gay، jwan awr bay wqwf، wh bhtryn alfaz bwlyn gay jw aadmy bwltay hyn، lykn an ka ayman an kay glay say nhyn atray ga، wh dyn say as trh nklyn gay jysay janwr say tyr nklta hay، jhan bhy tm an say mlw gay، anhyn mar dalw، an kw qtl krnay ka swab qyamt kay dn an kw mlay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3536,abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt kay dw grwh hwn gay jn myn say ayk grwh nklay ga awr jw hq kay qryb hwn gay wh an kay qtl ka zmh dar hwn gay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔
3537,jryr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh hj alwdaa kay mwqa pr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm myry mwt kay bad kbhy kfr ky trf mt lwtw awr ayk dwsray kay sr nh ktw۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3538,abwbkrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb dw mslman aaps myn mlyn gay awr an myn say ayk apnay bhayy kay khlaf hthyar athayay ga tw wh dwnwn jhnm kay dhanay pr hyn awr agr an myn say ayk dwsray kw qtl kr day ga tw dwnwn as myn dakhl hwn gay۔ hzrt abwbkrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jb dw mslman tlwaryn lay kr aaps myn mlyn gay tw qtl krnay wala awr marnay wala jhnm myn jayay ga۔ jb as nay (yany abwbkr rzy allh anh) kw qatl qrar dya awr pwchha kh maray janay walay ka kya qswr hay tw as nay jwab dya kh wh apnay sathy kw qtl krnay kay lyay bay chyn tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3539,hzrt ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh akl kay kchh lwg jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay thay awr anhwn nay aslam qbwl kya tha، anhwn nay mdynh kw bymar paya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn sdqh kay awntwn kay pas janay awr an ka pyshab awr dwdh pynay ka hkm dya۔ anhwn nay aysa kya awr tndrst hw gyay، js kay bad anhwn nay mrtd hw gyay، chrwahwn kw qtl kr dya awr awntwn kw bhga dya۔ chnanchh as nay an kay taaqb myn lwgwn kw bhyja awr jb wh layay gyay tw as nay an kay hath paon kat dyay awr an ky aankhyn nkal dyn awr anhyn bghyr ksy dagh kay mrnay kay lyay chhwr dya takh khwn ka bhao bnd hw jayay۔ ayk wrzhn ka khna hay kh an ky aankhwn myn nakhn dalay gyay thay۔ ayk awr khta hay kh as nay nakhn kw grm krnay ka hkm dya awr an kay sath andha krnay kay bad anhyn hrh pr phynk dya، awr agrchh wh pany ky bhyk mang rhay thay tw anhyn bghyr ksy pany kay mrnay kay lyay chhwr dya gya۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3540,'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm anhyn sdqh dynay ky trghyb dytay thay awr anhyn ksy kay sath mskh krnay say mna krtay thay۔ aba daod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3541,nsayy nay asay ans rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔
3542,abdalrhmn by۔ abdallh nay apnay wald kay hwalay say kha: jb myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath sfr myn tha awr aap qzayay hajt kay lyay tshryf lay gyay tw hm nay ayk hmrh kw dykha js myn dw chhwtay bchay thay awr bchwn kw lay gyay، as kay bad hmrh aaya awr apnay pr phylanay lga۔ phr jb nby krym sly allh alyh wslm tshryf layay tw aap nay frmaya kh as kay bchay kay khw janay say as kw ks nay dkh phnchaya hay، as kay bchay asay waps kr dw۔ as nay ayk chrya bhy dykhy jsay hm nay jlaya tha، jb as nay pwchha kh asay ks nay jlaya hay tw hm nay jwab dya kh hm nay jlaya hay، tw as nay kha: yh mnasb nhyn kh aag kay rb kay swa ksy kw aag say sza day۔‘‘ abwdaod nay rwayt ky hay۔ * ayk chhwta prndh jysa kh chrya، ya lark۔
3543,abwsayd khdry awr ans bn malk rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt myn akhtlaf awr tfrqh pyda hw jayay ga، kchh lwg achhy bat kryn gay lykn brayy kryn gay، wh qraan ky tlawt kryn gay lykn wh an kay glay say zyadh dwr nhyn jayay ga، wh dyn say as trh ht jayyn gay jysay tyr janwr kay andr say chla jata hay awr wh as jgh waps nhyn jayyn gay jb tk kh tyr aadmy kay andr say nh lg jayay۔ awr wh janwr mbark hyn jw an kw martay hyn awr wh lwgwn kw khda ky ktab ky trf blatay hyn، lykn jw an say lrta hay wh an say zyadh qryb hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha gya kh an kay pas kwn sa nshan hay tw aap nay frmaya kh yh mwndna hay۔* abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *thqyq kw yhan sr mndwanay awr balwn kw jrwn say nkalnay myn hd say tjawz krnay say tabyr kya gya hay۔
3544,aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy mslman aadmy ka khwn jw gwahy day kh allh kay swa kwyy mabwd nhyn awr mhmd sly allh alyh wslm allh kay rswl hyn srf tyn wjwhat myn say ksy ayk wjh say bhayay ja sktay hyn: shady kay bad zna، js swrt myn asay sngsar kya jayay، jw allh awr as kay rswl say lrnay kay lyay nklay، as swrt myn asay qtl kya jayay، ya swly pr chrhaya jayay، js myn qtl kya jayay ya qtl kya jayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ * myrqat iv۔ 53 as say mrad hayy way dkyty jysy chyzwn say hay۔
3545,abn aby lylyٰ khtay hyn kh anhyn mhmd sly allh alyh wslm kay sathywn nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath sfr myn jb an myn say ayk sw rha tha tw dwsra apnay sath waly rsy kay pas gya awr asay pkr lya، js say wh chwnk gya۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ksy mslman kay lyay yh jayz nhyn kh wh dwsray kw drayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *mtlb yh hay kh as nay as kay grd rsy bandhy jb wh sw rha tha، ghalbaً mzaq kay twr pr۔
3546,"hzrt abw drdaa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js nay zmyn hasl ky js pr tyks wajb hay 1 as nay apny hjrt kw mnswkh krnay ky kwshsh ky، awr js nay ksy kafr ky aajzy kw as ky grdn say atar kr asay apnay awpr dal lya as nay aslam say pyth phyr ly۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ 1. yhan \tyks\"" ka lfz jzyh hay۔ aakhr kar jzyh awr kharj kay drmyan frq kya gya، phlay kw pwl tyks kay lyay astamal kya jata tha awr dwsra lynd tyks kay lyay۔ 2. yany apnay aap kw zmy jysa bnana۔ 3. yany as kay lyay apna tyks ada krnay ky zmh dary athata hay۔"""
3547,"jryr by۔ abdallh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khsam ky trf ayk lshkr bhyja tw an myn say baz nay sjdh ryz hw kr allh say pnah mangy awr jldy say maray gyay۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay yh sna tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an kay lyay aadhay khwn ky qymt ada krnay ka hkm dya awr frmaya: \myn mshrkwn myn rhnay walay ksy mslman ka zmh dar nhyn hwn۔\"" yh pwchhay janay pr kh aysa kywn hay، as nay jwab dya، ’’an ky aag ayk dwsray kw nzr nhyn aany chahyay۔‘‘ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *khatm kay baz arkan jw mslman thay، yh swch kr khda kay hzwr sjdh ryz hw gyay kh as say hmlh aawrwn pr wazh hw jayay ga kh wh mslman hyn۔"""
3548,abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayman bay khbry myn qtl hwnay say hfazt ka zamn hay، mwmn dwsray kw bay khbry myn qtl nhyn krta۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3549,jryr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy ghlam bhag jayay awr shrk ky trf plt aayay tw asay hlal qtl kya ja skta hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3550,aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh ayk yhwdy jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw galy day rhy thy awr aap kw bra bhla khh rhy thy، ayk shkhs nay gla dba kr qtl kr dya awr nby sly allh alyh wslm nay as ky mwt kay bdlay myn kwyy maawzh ada krnay ky ajazt nhyn dy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3551,jndb nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jadwgr kw jw sza dy jaty hay wh tlwar ka war hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔
3552,asamh by sharq nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr as aadmy ka sr kat dw jw myry amt myn tfrqh dalay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔
3553,sharq by۔ shhab nay kha: myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ayk shaby say mlna chahta tha takh an say kharjywn kay baray myn pwchhwn۔ ayk thwar kay dn abw brzh aslmy say an kay chnd sathywn kay sath mlaqat hwyy، myn nay an say pwchha kh kya aap nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw kharjywn ka zkr krtay hwyay sna hay، tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh myn nay asay apnay kanwn say sna awr aankhwn say dykha hay۔ as nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw kchh mal laya gya awr asay tqsym kr dya، apnay dayyn awr bayyn walwn kw kchh dya، lykn pychhay walwn kw kchh nhyn dya۔ as kay pychhay walwn myn say ayk syah fam aadmy js kay bal balkl ktay hwyay thay awr js nay dw sfyd kpray phnay hwyay thay، phr khnay lgay kh mhmd tm nay ansaf kay sath tqsym nhyn ky۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm bht naraz hwyay awr frmaya: ”khda ky qsm kh myry mwt kay bad tm mjh say zyadh aadl aadmy nhyn pao gay“، anhwn nay mzyd kha: ”aakhry wqt myn as aadmy ky trh nzr aanay walay lwg qraan ky tlawt krtay hwyay nklyn gay، lykn yh an kay hlq say nhyn atray ga، wh aslam say as trh ar jayyn gay jysay tyr as khyl myn say gzrta hay js myn an ka nshan chlana jary rhay ga، awr wh nshan zdh hwn gay۔ jb tk kh an myn say aakhry djal kay sath nh nklay jb tm an say mlw gay tw wh sb say bdtr ansan awr hywan hwn gay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔
3554,"abw ghalb nay byan kya kh jb abw amamh nay dmshq kay rastay myn kchh sr rkhay hwyay dykhay tw frmaya: \jhnm kay ktay، aasman kay nychay maray janay walay bdtryn lwg، sb say bhtr wh hyn jw an kay hathwn maray gyay\""۔ as kay bad aap nay tlawt frmayy: js dn kchh chhray sfyd hwn gay awr kchh chhray syah hwn gay (alqraan، 3:106) abw amamh say pwchha gya kh kya aap nay asay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say sna hay tw jwab dya kh agr myn nay asay srf ayk bar، dw bar ya tyn bar sna hwta (sat mrtbh gn kr) myn aap kw nh btata۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn rwayt hay۔"""
3555,"abwhryrh awr zyd bn۔ khald rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh dw aadmy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay ayk jhgra lay kr aayay، an myn say ayk nay kha kh hmaray drmyan ktab allh kay mtabq fyslh kr dyjyay awr dwsray nay kha: ”han rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmaray drmyan ktab allh kay mtabq fyslh frma dyn awr mjhay bwlnay ky ajazt dyn۔ as nay asay bat krnay kw kha awr kha kh myra byta jw as aadmy kay sath mzdwr tha as nay apny bywy kay sath bdkary ky awr jb mjhay btaya gya kh myray bytay kw sngsar krna hay tw myn nay asay sw bhyr bkrywn awr apny ayk lwndy kay sath fdyh dya lykn jb myn nay ahl alm say pwchha tw anhwn nay btaya kh myray bytay kw sw kwray maray jayyn gay awr srf as mrd ky bywy kw ayk sal kay lyay jlawtn kya jayay ga۔ allh kay rswl nay jwab dya، \as ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، myn tmharay drmyan allh ky ktab kay mtabq fyslh zrwr krwn ga۔ tmhary bhyr awr tmhary lwndy tmhyn waps kr dy jayay gy، awr tmharay bytay kw sw kwray maray jayyn gay awr ayk sal kay lyay jlawtn kr dya jayay ga۔ tmhara talq hay، anys، as aadmy ky bywy kay pas jao، awr agr wh as ky bywy kw sngsar kr day\""۔ as nay aatraf kya awr as nay asay sngsar kr dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""
3556,zyd by۔ khald nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh hkm dytay hwyay sna hay kh jw ghyr shady shdh mrd zna kray asay sw kwray maray jayyn awr ayk sal kay lyay jlawtn kr dya jayay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔
3557,amr rzy allh anh nay kha: allh nay mhmd kw hq kay sath bhyja awr an pr ktab nazl ky، awr rjm ky aayt as myn shaml thy jw allh taalyٰ nay nazl ky thy۔ allh kay rswl kw lwgwn nay sngsar kya tha awr hm nay bhy an ky mwt kay bad say kya hay۔ sngsar krna khda ky ktab myn shady shdh mrdwn awr awrtwn kay lyay ayk frz hay jw sbwt sabt hwnay pr، ya hml hwnay ya aqrar krnay pr zna krtay hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3558,"abadh by۔ asmyt nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: \myry talym hasl krw، myry talym kw qbwl krw، khda nay an awrtwn kay lyay ayk tryqh mqrr kya hay (alqraan، 4:15) jb fryqyn ghyr shady shdh hwn tw anhyn sw kwray lgyn gay awr jb wh zna kryn gay tw anhyn ayk sal kay lyay jlawtn kya jayay ga awr jb wh shady shdh hwn gy tw anhyn sw kwray maray jayyn gay awr sngsar kr dya jayay ga۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""
3559,abdallh by۔ amr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh yhwdy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr aap say zkr kya kh an myn say ayk mrd awr ayk awrt nay zna kya hay۔ as nay an say pwchha kh anhwn nay twrat myn sngsary kay baray myn kya paya tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh anhyn rswa krna chahyay awr anhyn marna chahyay۔ abdallh by۔ phr slam nay kha kh tm jhwt bwltay hw، as myn yh hdayt hay kh anhyn sngsar kr dya jayay، lhza twrat lay aao۔ anhwn nay asay phyla dya awr an myn say ayk nay rjm ky aayt pr hath rkha awr prha kh as say phlay kya tha awr as kay bad kya tha۔ abdallh by۔ slam nay asay hath athanay kw kha awr jb as nay aysa kya tw as myn rjm ky aayt nzr aayy۔ phr anhwn nay kha mhmd as nay sch kha، as myn rjm ky aayt hay۔ phr nby sly allh alyh wslm nay an kay baray myn hkm dya awr anhyn sngsar kr dya gya۔ ayk rwayt myn hay kh as nay as say kha kh apna hath athao awr jb as nay aysa kya tw as myn rjm ky aayt saf thy۔ as shkhs nay phr kha kh as myn rjm ky aayt hay، lykn hm asay ayk dwsray say chhpa rhay hyn۔ phr as nay an kay baray myn hkm dya awr anhyn sngsar kr dya gya۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3560,"abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh ayk shkhs nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya jb aap msjd myn thay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay aap kw pkara kh myn nay zna kya hay، nby sly allh alyh wslm nay as say mnh phyr lya، tw wh shkhs aap sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay aaya awr kha kh myn nay zna kya hay، lykn nby sly allh alyh wslm nay mnh phyr lya۔ phr jb wh char mrtbh gwahy day chka tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay asay blaya awr frmaya: kya tm pagl hw؟ jb as nay jwab dya kh wh nhyn hay tw as nay as say pwchha kh kya wh shady shdh hay، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh wh hay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay lay jao awr asay sngsar kr dw۔ abn shhab nay kha: mjhay ayk shkhs nay khbr dy js nay jabr rzy allh anh kw sna۔ abdallh khtay hyn kh phr hm nay asay mdynh myn sngsar kya، lykn jb pthrwn say asay tklyf phnchy tw wh bhag gya، awr hm nay asay hrh myn pkr lya awr asay sngsar kr dya۔ bkhary ky trf say jabr ky rwayt pr، \anhwn nay jwab dya kh wh tha\"" kay bad yh khta hay kh anhwn nay an kay baray myn hkm dya awr nmaz ky jgh pr asay sngsar kya gya۔ phr jb pthrwn nay asay zkhmy kya tw wh bhaga، lykn pkra gya awr asay sngsar kr kay mar dala۔ phr nby sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay baray myn khwb kha awr as pr daa ky۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""
3561,abn abas nay kha kh jb mayz bn malk rzy allh anh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr aap nay frmaya: ”shayd tm nay bwsh lya hw، ya nchwra hw، ya dykha hw،“ anhwn nay jwab dya، ”nhyn، allh kay rswl۔ phr frmaya: kya tm nay as say hm bstry ky؟ saf lfzwn myn swal kya awr jb as nay jwab dya kh myray pas hay tw as nay hkm dya kh asay sngsar kr dya jayay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ *yany nby sly allh alyh wslm rwayt say yh andazh lgaya ja skta hay kh maz nay zna ka aqrar kya tha۔
3562,"brydh nay btaya kh mayz by۔ malk rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr kha: allh kay rswl mjhay pak kr dyn۔ as nay jwab dya، \tm pr! waps jao، allh say maafy mangw awr as ky trf twbh krw۔\"" as nay kha kh wh zyadh dwr waps nhyn gya، phr aaya awr kha kh aay allh kay rswl mjhay pak kr dyjyay awr nby sly allh alyh wslm nay why kha jw phlay khh chkay thay۔ jb yh bat chwthy bar tk chly tw as nay pwchha kh myn tmhyn ks chyz say pak krwn؟ awr as nay jwab dya kh yh zna ky wjh say hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay phr pwchha kh kya wh shkhs pagl hay، awr jb asay btaya gya kh wh nhyn tha، tw aap nay pwchha kh kya as nay shrab py hay؟ ayk aadmy atha awr as ky sans swnghy lykn shrab ky bw mhsws nh hwyy tw nby krym sly allh alyh wslm nay as say pwchha kh kya as nay zna kya hay، jb as nay jwab dya kh as kay pas hay tw as kay mtalq hkm dya awr asay sngsar kr dya gya۔ dw tyn dn kay bad rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm tshryf layay awr frmaya kh mayz bn malk kay lyay astghfar krw، anhwn nay as hd tk twbh ky hay kh agr ksy qwm myn tqsym hw jayay tw sb kay lyay kafy hay۔ phr ghamd ky ayk awrt jw azd ky ayk shakh thy aap kay pas aayy awr khnay lgy kh allh kay rswl mjhay pak kr dyn۔ as nay jwab dya، \""tm pr! waps jao، allh say maafy mangw awr as ky trf twbh krw۔\"" as nay kha kya tm mjhay waps bhyjna chahtay hw jysa kh tm nay mayz bn malk kw kya tha jb myn zna ky wjh say hamlh hwn؟ as nay pwchha kh kya wh apny trf asharh kr rhy hay، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh wh hay، tw as nay as say kha kh antzar krw jb tk kh as kay rhm myn mwjwd chyz kw jnm nh lay۔ ansar myn say ayk an ky zmh dary bny yhan tk kh as kay han bchh pyda hwa، phr wh nby kay pas gyy awr btaya kh ghamd ky awrt nay bchh jna hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as swrt myn hm asay sngsar nhyn kryn gay awr as kay bchay kw aysa hy chhwr dyn kh kwyy asay dwdh nh playay۔ phr ayk ansar nay ath kr kha kh myn as kay dwdh planay ka zmh dar hwn ga ya rswl allh! as kay bad as nay asay sngsar kr dya۔ ayk rwayt myn kha gya hay kh as nay as say kha kh wh as wqt tk chla jayay jb tk kh wh bchh pyda nh kr day، phr jb as nay aysa kya tw as nay asay kha kh wh chla jayay awr asay dwdh playay jb tk kh wh as ka dwdh chhra nh lay۔ jb as nay as ka dwdh chhraya tw wh as lrkay kw as kay pas lay aayy js kay hath myn rwty ka tkra tha awr kha kh myn nay as ka dwdh chhraya hay awr as nay khana kha lya hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay (mrghy nay lrkay kw mslmanwn myn say ayk kay hwalay kr dya، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay baray myn hkm dya awr asay as kay synh tk ayk swrakh myn dal dya gya tw aap nay lwgwn kw asay sngsar krnay ka hkm dya، khald bn wlyd ayk pthr lay kr aagay brhay jsay aap nay as kay sr pr phynka، awr jb as kay chhray pr khwn bhnay lga tw as pr lant bhyjy، lykn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: khald nay js kay hath myn nrmy say as ka hath phyr dya hay، as nay asay dwbarh hath myn lay lya hay۔ as hd tk kh agr ghlt tryqay say azafy tyks 2 lynay wala as hd tk twbh kray tw as ky maafy hw jayay gy۔\"" phr as kay baray myn hkm dytay hwyay aap nay as pr nmaz prhy awr asay dfn kya gya۔ mslm nay asay nql kya hay۔ 1۔ arby nay tysray shkhs kw yh khtay hwyay astamal kya kh wh hamlh hay۔ yh ayk wzahty jmlh hw skta hay، lykn myn nay as chhwtay jmlay kw aasany say prhnay ky kwshsh ky hay kywnkh as chhwtay say jmlay kw awrt ka hsh bnata hay۔ sahb myks zmanh jahlyt myn bazar myn frwkht knndgan say ly gyy rqm thy۔"""
3563,abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jb tm myn say ksy ky lwndy zna kray awr maamlh wazh hw tw asay chahyay kh asay mnasb maray، lykn asay bra nh khay، agr wh dwbarh kray tw asay mnasb maray، lykn asay bra nh khay، agr wh tysry bar kray awr as ka maamlh srf ayk bal kay bdlay myn hy frwkht hw tw as ka maamlh saf hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3564,"aly rzy allh anh nay kha: tm lwg apnay ghlamwn pr azab krw، an myn say jw shady shdh hyn awr jw nhyn hyn، kywnkh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky ayk lwndy nay zna kya awr mjhay as kw marnay ka hkm dya۔ lykn as nay hal hy myn ayk bchh kw jnm dya tha awr mjhay dr tha kh agr myn asay marwn ga tw myn asay qtl kr dwn ga، as lyay myn nay as ka zkr nby sly allh alyh wslm say kya tw aap nay frmaya: tm nay achha kya hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ abd daod ky rwayt myn hay kh \asay as wqt tk chhwr dw jb tk kh as ka khwn bhna bnd nh hw jayay، phr as pr azab nafz krw، awr apny lwndywn pr azab krw\""۔ abwdaod۔ *yhan fal jma hay۔"""
3565,"abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb maaz aslmy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr kha kh myn nay zna kya hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as say mnh mwr lya۔ phr wh dwsry trf aaya awr kha kh as nay zna kya hay، lykn as nay as say mnh mwr lya۔ wh phr aaya awr kha kh as nay zna kya hay، awr jb as nay chwthy bar yh kha tw rswl allhﷺ nay as kay baray myn hkm dya awr asay hrh myn lay ja kr sngsar kr dya gya۔ jb as nay pthrwn ka asr mhsws kya tw wh zwr say bhaga yhan tk kh ayk aadmy kay pas say gzra js kay pas awnt ka jbra tha js say as nay asay mara awr lwgwn nay asay mara yhan tk kh wh mr gya۔ phr anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say zkr kya kh aap nay pthrwn ka asr awr mwt ka lms mhsws kya tw aap bhag gyay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm nay asay akyla kywn nhyn chhwra؟ ayk wrzhn hay، \tm nay asay akyla kywn nhyn chhwra؟ shayd wh twbh kr lyta awr khda ky trf say maaf kr dya jata۔\"" asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
3566,abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay maaz bn say pwchha۔ mlk sahb: kya myn nay aap kay baray myn jw kchh sna hay wh sch hay؟ as nay pwchha kh as nay as kay baray myn kya sna hay، as nay jwab dya kh as nay sna hay kh as nay flan khandan ky lrky say hmbstry ky hay۔ jb as nay aqrar kya awr char mrtbh aqrar kya tw asay sngsar krnay ka hkm dya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ (yhan mslm ky ayk rwayt dfah dwm myn rkhy gyy hay۔)
3567,yzyd by۔ naym nay apnay wald ky trf say btaya kh maaz nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr aap ky mwjwdgy myn as bat ky char mrtbh tsdyq ky، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay rjm ka hkm dya، lykn hzl say kha kh agr tm asay apnay kpray say dhanp lytay tw tmharay lyay bhtr hwta۔ abn almnkdr khtay hyn kh hzl nay maaz kw hkm dya tha kh wh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ja kr btayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3568,amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky trf say btaya kh an kay dada abdallh bn amrw by۔ alaas rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aaps myn tay shdh szaon kw maaf kr dw، kywnkh jw bhy mqrrh sza myn nay sna hay as pr aml krna zrwry hay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔
3569,aayshh rzy allh anha say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwgwn ky khwbywn kw maaf kr dw، lykn an ky ghltywn kw nhyn jn pr jrmanh aayd hwta hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3570,anhwn nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’mslmanwn pr mqrrh szaon kw js hd tk hwskay tal dw، awr agr kwyy rasth hay tw aadmy kw chhwr dw، kywnkh lydr kay lyay maaf krnay myn ghlty krna sza dynay myn ghlty krnay say bhtr hay۔‘‘ trmzy nay asay nql kya hay، awr kha hay kh yh an ky trf say nby sly allh alyh wslm kw bghyr ksy sragh kay mntql kya gya hay، awr yh shyh hay۔
3571,wayl b۔ hjr nay kha kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn ayk awrt kw as ky mrzy kay khlaf mjbwr kya jata tha tw aap nay as say azab tal dya lykn as kay sath zyadty krnay walay pr dal dya۔ transmytr nay as bat ka zkr nhyn kya kh as nay asay ada krnay kay lyay mhr mqrr kya۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔
3572,"anhwn nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn ayk awrt nmaz kay lyay nkly tw ayk aadmy jw as say mla as nay as pr hmlh kya awr as ky khwahsh pwry kr ly۔ wh chlayy awr wh chla gya، phr jb mhajryn ky ayk jmaat aayy tw as nay kha kh as shkhs nay myray sath flan kam kya۔ wh as aadmy kw pkr kr allh kay rswl kay pas lay aayay، aap nay as awrt say kha، \chlay jao، kywnkh allh nay tmhyn maaf kr dya hay\"" lykn as shkhs kay baray myn js nay as say hm bstry ky thy، as nay kha، \""asay sngsar kr dw۔\"" aap nay yh bhy frmaya kh as nay as hd tk twbh ky hay kh agr mdynh walay bhy asy trh twbh krtay tw an say qbwl hwty۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
3573,jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nay ayk awrt kay sath zna kya tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay hkm dya kh asay mnasb mara jayay، lykn bad myn jb yh btaya gya kh wh shkhs shady shdh hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hkm dya kh asay rjm kr dya jayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3574,sayd by۔ sad b۔ abadh nay kha kh sad bn abadh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk aysay shkhs kw lay kr aaya jw tamyr myn kmzwr awr bymar tha، qbylh ka ayk frd، jw an ky ayk lwndy say najayz jmaa krtay hwyay paya gya tha۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: as kay lyay khjwr kay drkht ky ayk sw thnyan lay kr ayk bar marw۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔ awr abn majh ky rwayt myn bhy kchh aysa hy hay۔
3575,akrmh rzy allh anh nay abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt ky hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm ksy kw lwt alyh alslam ky qwm ky trh krtay hwyay pao tw as kay krnay walay kw awr js kay sath kya jayay asay qtl kr dw“۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔
3576,abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy janwr say hmbstry kray tw asay qtl kr dw awr asay bhy as kay sath mar dalw“۔ abn abas rzy allh anh say pwchha gya kh janwr say kya jrm kya ja skta hay tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as baray myn kchh nhyn sna، lykn myra khyal hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay gwsht khanay ya as kay astamal kw napsnd kya hay jb as kay sath aysa kya gya tha۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔
3577,jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mjhay apny qwm kay baray myn sb say zyadh dr why hay jw lwt ky qwm nay kya tha۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔
3578,"abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh bkr rzy allh anh kay ayk aadmy nay۔ lys nby kay pas aaya awr char bar byan kya kh as nay ayk awrt kay sath zna kya hay tw as nay asay sw kwray lgayay۔ as aadmy ky shady nhyn hwyy thy۔ phr as nay as awrt say dwbarh sbwt pysh krnay kw kha، awr as nay kha، \khda ky qsm، khda kay rswl، as nay jhwt bwla hay۔\"" phr asay jhwt kay lyay kwrwn ky mqrrh tadad dy gyy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""
3579,aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: jb myry dlyl nazl hwyy (alqraan، 24:11 ff) nby sly allh alyh wslm nay mnbr pr chrha awr as ka zkr kya۔ phr jb aap mnbr say atray tw aap nay hkm dya kh dwnwn mrd awr awrt* kw mshrwa mara jayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ * kha jata hay kh yh mrd msth b thay۔ atha awr hsn by۔ sabt awr awrt hmnh bnt jhsh۔ abn abd albr، astyaab۔ s 285، ka khna hay kh msth kw mara pyta gya tha، lykn wh khwd kw py pr artkab nhyn krta hay۔ 127 hsn kay baray myn، ya s pr۔ hmnh kay baray myn 714۔
3580,nafa nay kha kh anhyn abw abyd ky byty sfyh nay atlaa dy thy kh khlyfh kay ghlamwn myn say ayk nay ayk lrky say mbashrt ky hay jw mal ghnymt kay panchwyn hsay myn say thy، asay as ky mrzy kay khlaf zbrdsty as pr mjbwr kya awr asay bay dkhl kr dya۔ amr rzy allh anh nay asay mara lykn as ky ptayy nhyn ky kywnkh as nay asay as ky mrzy kay khlaf mjbwr kya tha۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔
3581,yzyd by۔ naym b۔ hzal nay apnay wald kay hkm say kha kh mayz bn۔ malk jw apnay wald ky hfazt myn ayk ytym tha as nay qbylh ky ayk lwndy say hmbstry ky tw as kay wald nay asay kha kh ja kr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw btao kh as nay kya kya hay، shayd wh as kay lyay maafy mangyn۔ as myn as ka mqsd mhz ayk amyd thy kh shayd yh as kay lyay frar ka rasth hw۔ wh as kay pas gya awr kha: aay khda kay rswl، myn nay zna kya hay، as lyay khda ky trf say mjh pr azab nazl frma۔ as nay as say mnh phyr lya tw wh waps aaya awr khnay lga: aay khda kay rswl myn nay zna kya hay as lyay khda ky trf say mjh pr azab nazl frma۔ jb wh char bar khh chka tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm nay char bar kha، ks kay sath kya؟ jb as nay jwab dya kh yh flan kay sath hay tw as nay pwchha kh kya as nay as kay sath shbt ky hay tw as nay jwab dya kh as kay pas hay۔ as nay pwchha kh kya as ky jld as kay sath rabtay myn thy awr as nay jwab dya kh aysa hwa hay۔ phr as nay pwchha kh kya as nay as say hmbstry ky hay tw as nay jwab dya kh as nay kya hay۔ as nay asay sngsar krnay ka hkm dya awr asay bahr lay jaya gya، lykn jb as nay pthrwn ka asr mhsws kya awr asay brdasht nh kya tw wh jldy say chla gya۔ lykn abdallh by۔ anys ka as wqt samna hwa jb asay sngsar krnay walay asay pkr nh skay، awnt ky pyshany ky hdy as pr phynk dy، asay mara awr mar dala۔ phr jb wh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya awr aap say as ka zkr kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh tm nay asay akyla kywn nhyn chhwra، shayd wh twbh kr lyta awr allh ky trf say maafy ml jaty۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ * fal jma myn hay۔
3582,amrw by۔ alaas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: ”zna ksy qwm myn zahr nhyn hw ga jb tk kh asay qht ky sza nh dy jayay، awr ksy qwm myn rshwt khwry as wqt zahr nhyn hw gy jb tk kh anhyn dhsht grdy ky sza nh dy jayay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔
3583,abn abas awr abwhryrh rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mlawn hay wh jw aysa kray jw lwt ky qwm nay kya tha۔
3584,abn abas rzy allh anh ky rwayt myn hay kh aly rzy allh anh nay an dw lwgwn kw jla dya tha awr abwbkr rzy allh anh nay an pr dywar gra dy thy۔ razn nay asay mntql kya۔
3585,abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ as shkhs ky trf nhyn dykhay ga jw mqad kay zryaay ksy mrd ya awrt say jmaa krta hay۔ trmzy nay asay nql krtay hwyay kha؛ yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔
3586,"aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay yh byan kya kh \janwr say jmaa krnay walay kay lyay kwyy sza mqrr nhyn hay۔\"" asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔ trmzy nay sfyan alswry ka hwalh dytay hwyay kha hay kh yh phly rwayt say zyadh shyh hay kh ’’janwr say jmaa krnay walay kw qtl krdw‘‘ (jf 763) awr as kay mtabq aalm aml krta hay۔"""
3587,"abadh by۔ asmyt nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \qryb awr dwr walwn pr allh ky mqrr krdh szaon kw nafz krw، awr allh kay [azabwn kay nfaz] kay baray myn ksy ka qswr tm pr nh aayay۔\"" asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""
3588,abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh kay mqrr krdh azabwn myn say ksy ayk kw nafz krna allh ky zmyn myn chalys ratwn ky barsh say bhtr hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔
3589,nsayy nay asay abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔
3590,aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: chwr ka hath chwthayy dynar awr as say awpr katna chahyay۔ (bkhary w mslm)۔
3591,abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay tyn drhm ky dhal kay lyay ayk chwr ka hath kata۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3592,abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khda ky lant hw as chwr pr jw anda chrayay awr as ka hath kat dya jayay، awr rsy chwry ky jayay awr as ka hath kat dya jayay۔“* (bkhary w mslm)* yh tjwyz kya gya hay kh bydh (anda ya fwlad ka hylmt) ka aakhry many hwna chahyay awr yh kh jhaz ky rsy smjhy jayay، lykn aam twr pr mndrjh bala trjmh kw qbwl kya jata hay۔
3593,rfya by۔ hzrt khdyj rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”phl lynay ya khjwr kay grhay pr hath nhyn kata jayay ga۔ asay malk، trmzy، abwdaod، nsayy، darmy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔
3594,amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hkm pr apnay dada abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh kw kha۔ amrw by۔ alaas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say ltkayay hwyay phl kay baray myn pwchha gya tw aap nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy as myn say kchh chwry kr kay asay khshk jgh pr rkh day awr as ky qymt dhal kay brabr hw tw as ka hath kat dya jayay“۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔
3595,abdallh by۔ abdalrhmn by۔ abw hsyn mky rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ltkayay gyay phl kay lyay ya phar say rat kw chwry hwnay waly bkry kay lyay hath nhyn kata jayay ga، blkh jb bhyr apnay gwday myn hw ya phl as jgh pr hw jhan asay swkha jayay tw hath kata jayay jw dhal ky qymt tk phnch jayay۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔ * harsh jbl۔ yh phar say waps aanay say phlay chwry shdh bhyr ya bkry ka astamal kya jata hay، ya phar pr phray dar kay lyay۔ nskhay ky sb say zyadh tsly bkhsh wjh yh malwm hwty hay kh phar myn rkhay gyay janwrwn kw khatr khwah thfz nhyn dya jata۔
3596,jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” hath katna lwt mar krnay walay ka nhyn hay، lykn jw shkhs aysa krta hay wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3597,anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: khyant krnay walay، lwt mar krnay walay ya chhynnay walay ka hath katna nhyn hay۔ asay trmzy، nsayy، abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔
3598,shrh alsn myn hay kh sfwan bn۔ amyh mdynh aayay awr apny chadr kw tkyh kay twr pr astamal krtay hwyay msjd myn sw gyay۔ ayk chwr aaya awr as ky chadr lay gya awr sfwan asay pkr kr rswl allhﷺ kay pas lay aaya aap nay as ka hath katnay ka hkm dya۔ phr sfwan nay kha kh yh myra aradh nhyn tha myn asay sdqh krta hwn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm nay asay myray pas lanay say phlay aysa kywn nhyn kya؟
3599,abn majh nay abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh say asy trh ky rwayt nql ky hay۔ sfwan js nay apnay wald kay akhtyar ka hwalh dya۔
3600,darmy nay bhy abn abas rzy allh anhma say aysa hy kya۔
3601,"bsr b. artt nay byan kya kh as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh \jngy mhm kay dwran hath nh katay jayyn۔\"" trmzy، darmy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay asay nql kya hay، lykn aakhry dw myn \""jngy mhm\"" ky jgh \""sfr\"" hay۔"""
3602,abw slmh nay abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt nql ky hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay chwr kay baray myn frmaya: chwry kray tw hath kat day، dwbarh chwry kray tw paon kat day، dwbarh chwry kray tw hath kat day awr dwbarh chwry kray tw paon kat lay۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔
3603,jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk chwr laya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”asay mym krw، tw yh kya gya، asay dwsry bar laya gya awr as nay kha، ”asay“ tw yh kya gya، tysry bar laya gya awr as nay kha: ”asay“ tw aysa kya gya، asay chwthy bar laya gya awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay kha: ”asay“ tw aysa kya gya، aap sly allh alyh wslm asay lay gyay awr panchwyn mrtbh asay qtl kr dya۔ asay ghsyt kr knwyn myn dal dya awr asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔
3604,shrh alsn myn hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay chwr kay aazaa kay baray myn frmaya kh ’’as ka asa krw، phr asay dagh dw‘‘۔
3605,fdala by۔ abyd rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk chwr laya gya، jb as ka hath kata gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hkm dya kh asay as ky grdn myn ltka dya jayay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔
3606,abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy ghlam chwry kray tw asay bych dalay، agrchh wh aadha awqyh hy kywn nh hw۔“* asay abwdaod، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔ * nash، yh nsf awqyh ya bys drhm hay۔
3607,aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb ayk chwr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas laya gya awr as ka hath kat dya gya tw asay lanay walwn nay kha kh hm nay swcha bhy nhyn tha kh aap as kay sath as qdr aagay brhyn gay۔ as nay jwab dya kh agr fatmh hwty tw myn as ka hath kat dyta۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔
3608,abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh ayk shkhs apnay ghlam kw amr rzy allh anh kay pas laya awr kha: as ka hath kat dw، kywnkh as nay myry bywy ka aayynh chra lya hay۔ amr rzy allh anh nay jwab dya kh hath katna as pr nhyn pr skta، yh aap ka nwkr hay js nay aap ka saman lya hay۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔
3609,"abwzr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an kw nam lay kr mkhatb kya tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh aap ky khdmt myn awr aap ky rza kay lyay ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm kya krw gay jb mwt 1 lwgwn kw maray gy awr ayk ghr yany qbr ky qymt ayk ghlam kay brabr hw gy؟ as kay jwab pr kh khda awr as ka rswl bhtr jantay hyn، anhwn nay kha kh sbr ka mzahrh krw۔ hmad by [abw] slyman nay kha kh qbr 2 pr rayfl chlanay walay ka hath kat dya jayay kywnkh wh myt kay ghr myn dakhl hwa tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ 1. yhan \mwt\"" kw ayk shdyd wba kay lyay btwr aadad astamal kya gya hay۔ 2. mrqat، iv، 59، khtay hyn kh yh kfn chranay kay lyay kya jata hay۔"""
3610,aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh qrysh as mkhzwmy awrt kay baray myn fkr mnd thay js nay chwry ky thy awr pwchha: as kay baray myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kwn bat kray ga؟ phr anhwn nay kha kh as kay lyay kwn dlyr hw ga swayay asamh bn zyd kay jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay dwst hyn؟ tw asamh rzy allh anh nay an say bat ky awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm allh ky mqrr krdh szaon myn say ksy ky sfarsh kr rhay hw؟ as kay bad wh athay awr khtab krtay hwyay frmaya kh tmharay pyshrwon kw js chyz nay tbah kya tha wh yh tha kh jb an myn say kwyy shkhs chwry krta tha tw asay tnha chhwr dytay thay lykn jb an myn say ksy kmzwr nay chwry ky thy tw as kw mqrrh sza dytay thay، khda ky qsm agr fatmh bnt mhmd nay chwry ky tw myn as ka hath kat dwn ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)۔ mslm kay ayk nskhay myn anhwn nay kha kh ayk mkhzwmy awrt saman adhar lyty thy awr asay lynay say ankar krty thy، as lyay nby sly allh alyh wslm nay hkm dya kh as ka hath kat dya jayay۔ as kay ghr walwn nay ja kr asamh say bat ky awr as nay as kay baray myn rswl allh ﷺ say bat ky۔ phr as rwayt kw asy shkl myn zkr kya jw as say phlay hay۔
3611,"abdallh by۔ amr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh agr ksy ky shfaat allh ky mqrr krdh szaon myn say ksy myn rkawt bnty hay tw as nay allh ky mkhalft ky، agr kwyy jhwty bat myn jan bwjh kr jhgrta hay tw wh allh ky narazgy myn sb say zyadh rhta hay jb tk kh wh baz nh aajayay، awr agr kwyy jhwty thmt lgayay tw allh taalyٰ ky trf say as pr allh ky trf say bhtan hw jayay ga۔ jhnmywn say* yhan tk kh wh apnay qwl say mkr jayay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔ *rdghat alkhbl۔ shab alayman myn byhqy ky ayk rwayt myn hay kh \jw shkhs ksy jhgray myn mdd kray، yh nh janay kh wh sch hay ya jhwt، wh allh ky narazgy myn rhay ga yhan tk kh wh baz aajayay۔\"" byhqy shab alayman myn"""
3612,abw amyh almkhzwmy nay byan kya kh ayk dakw js nay aqrar kya tha rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas laya gya lykn as kay pas say kwyy saman nhyn mla۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as say frmaya: mjhay nhyn lgta kh tm nay chwry ky hay۔ as nay jwab dya kh as kay pas tha awr asay dw tyn bar dhraya، hr wqt aqrar krta rha، chnanchh as nay hkm dya awr as ka hath kat dya gya۔ phr asay as kay pas laya gya awr rswl allhﷺ nay as say frmaya: ’’allh say maafy mangw awr as ky trf twbh krw۔‘‘ as nay kha kh myn khda say maafy mangta hwn awr as ky trf twbh krta hwn۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay tyn bar frmaya: aay allh asay maaf kr day۔ abwdaod، nsayy، abn majh awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay۔ chnanchh myn nay asay abw amyh ky rwayt say jama alslw، shab alayman awr malm alsnn myn nql shdh char nsws myn paya۔
3613,lykn almsabyh ky nsws myn yh abw rmsh say mrwy hay۔
3614,ans rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay shrab pynay pr khjwr ky shakhwn awr jwtwn say mara awr abwbkr rzy allh anh nay chalys kwray lgayay۔ bkhary w mslm۔
3615,an ky snd kay ayk nskhay myn hay kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm shrab pynay kay lyay khjwr ky shakhwn awr jwtwn kay sath chalys dharyan dytay thay۔
3616,alsayb b۔ yzyd nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn، abwbkr rzy allh anh ky khlaft myn awr amr rzy allh anh ky khlaft kay aaghaz myn shrab pynay walay kw laya gya tw hm nay asay apnay hathwn، jwtwn awr chadrwn say mara، lykn amr rzy allh anh ky khlaft kay aakhr myn as nay chalys kwray maray، awr jb lwg bay hyayy kay sath aath maray gyay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔
3617,jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shrab pyay asay marw، awr agr chwthy bar pyay tw asay qtl kr dw“۔ as nay kha kh as kay bad ayk aadmy js nay char mrtbh shrab py thy، nby krymﷺ kay pas laya gya tw aapﷺ nay asay mara، lykn asay qtl nhyn kya۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay awr abwdaod nay asay qblh s say rwayt kya hay۔ zhyb۔
3618,daod nay asay qblsh b ky snd say nql kya hay۔ zhyb۔
3619,"an dwnwn ka ayk awr nskhh awr nsayy، abn majh awr darmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay baz ashab، jn myn abn amr، maawyh، abwhryrh awr alshryd shaml hyn، ky snd say \asay qtl kr dw\"" pr rwka hay۔"""
3620,abdalrhmn by۔ alazhr nay kha: myn ab bhy apnay aap kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky trf dykh rha hwn jb ayk shkhs kw aap kay samnay laya gya awr as nay lwgwn say kha kh asay marw۔ ksy nay asay syndl say mara، ksy nay lathywn say awr ksy nay mthas say۔ abn whb nay kha kh as say mrad sbz khjwr kay jhnd hyn۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay zmyn say kchh mty nkal kr apnay chhray pr dal dy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3621,"abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas shrab pynay walay ayk aadmy kw laya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh asay marw، ksy nay asay apnay hathwn say mara، ksy nay apnay kprwn say awr ksy nay apnay jwtwn say۔ phr as nay an say kha kh wh asay mlamt kryn، awr anhwn nay as ka samna kya awr kha، \tm nay khda ky azt nhyn ky، tm nay khda say nhyn dra، awr tm nay khda kay rswl kay samnay shrmndh nhyn kya\""۔ lykn jb lwgwn myn say kchh nay kha، \""khda nay aap kw shrmndh kya!\"" as nay an say kha kh aysa nh khw awr shytan kw as pr qabw panay myn mdd krw، blkh yh khna kh \""aay khda asay maaf krday، aay khda as pr rhm kr۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""
3622,abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh ayk shkhs jw nshay myn tha wh rastay myn lrkhrata hwa paya gya، tw asay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas lay jaya gya، lykn jb wh abas rzy allh anh kay ghr kay samnay phncha tw wh frar hw gya، awr abas rzy allh anh kay pas ja kr asay pkr lya۔ jb nby sly allh alyh wslm kw yh btaya gya tw aap hns pray awr frmaya: kya as nay aysa kya؟ awr as nay as kay baray myn kwyy hkm nhyn dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔
3623,amyr by۔ sayd nkhay nay byan kya kh anhwn nay aly rzy allh anh kw sna۔ abw talb khtay hyn kh myn ksy aysay shkhs kay baray myn kwyy jzbat rkhnay wala nhyn hwn jw as shkhs kay baray myn jw myn as pr kwyy mqrrh sza day kr mrjaon، swayay as kay js nay shrab py hw، kywnkh agr wh mr jayay tw myn as kay lyay khwn ka atyh dwn ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)
3624,thwr by۔ zyd dylmy nay byan kya kh amr rzy allh anh nay shrab pynay ky mshrwa sza kay baray myn mshwrh tlb kya awr aly rzy allh anh nay an say kha kh myra khyal hay kh tm shrab pynay walay kw asy kwray dw kywnkh jb wh shrab pyta hay tw nshh krta hay، jb nshh krta hay tw brbrata hay awr jb brbrata hay tw jhwt bwlta hay۔ chnanchh amr rzy allh anh nay shrab pynay ky sza kay twr pr asy kwray lgayay۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔
3625,"amr by۔ alkhtab nay byan kya kh abdallh namy ayk shkhs js ka lqb gda tha nby sly allh alyh wslm kw hnsaya krta tha۔ nby sly allh alyh wslm nay asay shrab pynay ky wjh say mara tha، lykn jb ayk dn aap sly allh alyh wslm kay pas laya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hkm dya awr mara pyta، phr whan mwjwd lwgwn myn say ayk nay kha: aay allh as pr lant bhyj، asay ktny bar laya jata hay۔ as nay kha، \as pr bddaa nh krw۔ myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn janta hwn kh wh khda awr as kay rswl say mhbt krta hay۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""
